  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sindh Flood Emergency Housing Reconstruction Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project Development Objective (PDO) is to deliver beneficiary&#x2010;driven, multi&#x2010;hazard resilient, reconstruction of core housing units to the populace affected by the 2022 floods in selected districts of Sindh province. The aim of the project is to directly contribute to the national targets related to SDG-11 and SDG-13 by delivering robust houses that are resistant and adapted to the adverse conditions of climate change and natural disasters. The project contributes to the SDG-6 by improving access to water supply and sanitation services for rural population.</narrative>
  </description>
